<title>NEW ZEALAND: PDL confirms profit to hit NZ$12.5-13 mln. [CORRECTED 23:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>PDL confirms profit to hit NZ$12.5-13 mln. [CORRECTED 23:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electrical goods manufacturer PDL Holdings Ltd on Monday confirmed a post-tax (corrects from pre-tax) profit forecast of NZ$12.5-13 million for its 1996/97 year.</p>
<p>PDL said sales in the year were a record $334 million.  </p>
<p>The forecast profit range was in line with a forecast made in the company's third quarter report.</p>
<p>The release of its audited annual results is due in the week commencing June 2.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
